 * How to do a built-in exercise: [steps] is one string with the numbered steps separated by line
 * breaks ("\n"), [tips] the key cues and common mistakes, also one per line. Both are string
 * resources `exg_<id>_steps` / `exg_<id>_tips` (tools/i18n/src/<locale>/97_exercise_guides.txt),
 * listed explicitly here so resource shrinking keeps them.
 */
